                                                "sense_id": "6e535076-acfd-30b1-b6d9-be02d10743db",
                                                "text": "It were superfluous to describe the Process of making the Aqua fortis; it shall suffice to let you know, that our common Coperas makes this Aquafortis well enough for our purpose[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2db4d4e2-a192-464a-b618-026032eaa23f",
                                                "sense_id": "6e535076-acfd-30b1-b6d9-be02d10743db",
                                                "text": "[…] what a change has introduced itself everywhere into human affairs! How human affairs shall now circulate everywhere not healthy life-blood in them, but, as it were, a detestable copperas banker’s ink;"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2b418576-deb7-347e-a0c7-bc12d45a7bcc",
